This is a fantastic game, with an active community involved in modding and multiplayer. It is really fun, and when you get bored of it, you can just try out a few mods that change the whole era of the game (Kaiserreich, Millenium Dawn, The Great War mod, etc.}
However, Paradox has become extremely greedy with the base game. You have to pay an additional $30 to get the entire experience of Hoi4, which doesn't really add much to the game . I have not bothered to buy the DLC, since I am not gonna pay $30 for a few focus trees and cosmetics. If you buy this game, do not get lured into the trap that is Paradox's DLC. Stick to the FREE mods if you want refreshing content (like the ones states above)
Tl;dr: This was such a great game, with so much potential, all to be ruined by Paradox Interactive's greed.

