Why should you spend your money on a game that seems like a dating sim with pigeons?
- Because you should never (or almost never) judge a book by its cover and I swear this is one of the case, because you start the game laughing and you end it crying and wishing to set your body on fire to feel less pain;
- Because the characters, every single one, even though they are birds, make you feel something that almost every game should make you feel: empathy;
- Because the BBL is a gem;
- Because the music is a piece of art alone;
- Because it's not a disappointment.
10/10!

